Package: dvwa-android
Version: 2.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, curl
Recommends: termux-tools
Homepage: https://github.com/termux-learn-crypto/dvwa-android
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Downloads and opens the DVWA Android APK
 Fetches dvwa-native v2.1.1 APK from GitHub releases into
 ~/storage/downloads (or ~/dvwa-android) and opens the Android
 installer with termux-open. Command: dvwa-android.
